  "limitations": [
    "Trellis35 remains experimental and the deferred long quality suite is not reopened by this packet.",
    "The sampled raw files record the implementation parent plus a dirty worktree; the executable hash binds all candidate measurements to the tested binary.",
    "T3 native conversion grows static code and uses three more registers, but measured operator and end-to-end throughput both improve without spills.",
    "The full sampled comparison against WP25 is contextual; the same-binary 512-token A/B panels are the primary attribution evidence."
  ],
  "decision": "retain native packed FP8x4 conversion by default for M1 N128 and T3 M16; retain independent environment rollbacks and leave prefill scalar"
